  <title>Hitzordu bat editatzea</title>

  <p>Lehendik zure egutegian dagoen hitzordu bat aldatu nahi baduzu:</p>

  <steps>
    <item>
      <p>Egin klik bikoitza editatuko den egutegiko hitzorduan.</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Edit the appointment (see
      <link xref="calendar-usage-add-appointment">Adding an Appointment</link>
      for the list of available options).</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Click the <gui style="button">Save</gui> button, or
      <guiseq><gui>File</gui><gui>Save</gui></guiseq>.</p>
    </item>
  </steps>

</page>
